DISSIDENTS.

IN ACCORDANCE WITH RECENT TRADE AND MUTUAL DEFENSE PACT 
RESOLUTION 534-6166, ELEMENTS OF THE 27TH MECHANIZED REGIMENT
HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO THE REGION. 

THE 33RD TANK GUARDS, AS PART OF THE 27TH, HAS BEEN AMONG THE 
FIRST TO ARRIVE IN COUNTRY. 

OVER TWO WEEKS OF INTENSE BUT ISOLATED FIGHTING HAS LED TO THE 
33RD'S INCLUSION IN THE CONFLICT. 

1ST TROOP HAS BEEN ISSUED ORDERS TO RELINQUISH ITS DUG IN POSITION 
AND ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 067ø EAST AND NORTH. YOUR MISSION 
OBJECTIVE IS TO AID 2ND TROOP IN ELIMINATING ILLEGAL NATO 
MULTILATERAL FORCES' ENCLAVES CONTROLLING THE NORTH/EAST CORRIDOR. 

2ND TROOP, ALREADY CAUGHT IN BATTLE, IS ORDERED TO PROCEED ON A 
COURSE HEADING OF 083ø EAST AND SOUTH THROUGH NATO CONTROLLED 
TERRITORY. YOUR MISSION OBJECTIVE IS THE EXPEDIENT REMOVAL OF THE 
NATO FORWARD COMMAND BASE.
